The files in chromium/patches/ change Chromium source files. The changed
Chromium code remains under Chromium's licence; Resolute's own additions are
covered by Resolute's LICENSE.

If code from Kiwi Browser (BSD 3-Clause) or Mises Browser (MPL 2.0) is reused,
its notice is added here, and MPL 2.0 files stay under MPL 2.0.

Extensions installed by users from the Chrome Web Store (for example MetaMask)
are not part of Resolute and belong to their own developers.
